{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00902","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 晋阳武 · 柳宗元","name":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 晋阳武","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋阳武，奋义威。\n炀之渝，德焉归。\n氓毕屠，绥者谁。\n皇烈烈，专天机。\n号以仁，扬其旗。\n日之升，九土曦。\n斥田圻，流洪辉。\n有其二，翼余隋。\n斮枭骜，连熊螭。\n枯以肉，勍者羸。\n后土荡，玄穹弥。\n合之育，莽然施。\n惟德辅，庆无期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}